      "message": "So this config will tell us if the battery is physically present. But we need to use/implement the function battery_is_present like for eg:- https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/927798/3/board/glkrvp/battery.c#217 which will initiate I2C to battery and see if status is initialized only then return the status. This will help in battery cutoff scenario too.",
